  lam=1.0: mean sq cross-sim 0.0341   float acc 1.00   int8 acc 1.00   retention 1.00
PASS  the loss makes the cloud measurably more isotropic   | 0.0431 -> 0.0341 (21% less cross-similarity)
PASS  int8 retention is not WORSE with it
PASS  HONEST NULL: this toy saturates, so it cannot demonstrate the quantization WIN   | both variants retrieve perfectly at int8 (1.00); the paper's claim needs a task hard enough that quantization error changes a ranking — what we verified is the MECHANISM (isotropy)
